A reasonably quick way to gain HP fast is to first reverse genocide
cockatrices and then some arch liches. Stoning monsters prevents them
using their potions of gain level and full healing, and then you can
extract them with a wand of striking. By the time two cockatrice
corpses have rotted away there should be enough potions to gain
150-200 HP. It pays to position yourself so that not too many monsters
smash the statues with wands of striking. [Note that this is not
exactly safe, this weekend I died two times doing this when captains
bashed me with cockatrice corpses. Luckily, I had an amulet of life
saving on both times.]

